Object: web/prod/assets/app.js
Header Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
Header Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains
Header X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
Header X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
Header X-Site: prod

$ nexoctl dist test mem site /old/page.html
Route: www.example.com → distribution `site` (alias www.example.com)
Behavior: default
Access: public
Settings: access public, index index.html, spa /index.html
