$ nexoctl dist sign-url mem site /downloads/v1.zip --expire 1h
https://www.example.com/downloads/v1.zip?Expires=1767326645&Key-Pair-Id=KMEM0006&Signature=mem-signature

$ nexoctl dist sign-url mem site /downloads/v1.zip --expire 1h --cookie
Set-Cookie: CloudFront-Policy=mem-policy; Expires=Fri, 02 Jan 2026 04:04:05 UTC; Secure; HttpOnly
Set-Cookie: CloudFront-Signature=mem-signature; Expires=Fri, 02 Jan 2026 04:04:05 UTC; Secure; HttpOnly
Set-Cookie: CloudFront-Key-Pair-Id=KMEM0006; Expires=Fri, 02 Jan 2026 04:04:05 UTC; Secure; HttpOnly

$ nexoctl dist sign-url mem site /index.html --expire 1h
! nexoctl: error: distribution "site": invalid argument: /index.html is served by a behavior with access "public": only the signed behaviors verify signatures
[exit 1]

$ nexoctl dist keygroup rm mem downloads
! nexoctl: error: key group "downloads": key group downloads is used by the distribution site (conflict)
[exit 1]

$ nexoctl dist origin-secret rotate mem site
New origin secret of `site` (header X-Origin-Secret, 1 active, shown once):
mem-origin-secret-13

$ nexoctl dist cert set mem site --cert cert.pem --key key.pem
Uploaded the certificate dist-site (www.example.com, example.com, valid until 2026-04-02 03:04:05 UTC); TLS of `site`: upload:dist-site.

$ nexoctl dist cert set mem api --auto
TLS of `api`: auto.

$ nexoctl dist cert ls mem
ID                       SOURCE  STATUS         EXPIRES                 DOMAINS                  USED BY
dist-site                upload  valid          2026-04-02 03:04:05 UTC www.example.com,example.com site
ACME acme-api pending for s3.example.com (distributions api)

$ nexoctl dist cert rm mem dist-site
! nexoctl: error: certificate "dist-site": certificate dist-site is used by the distributions site (conflict)
[exit 1]

$ nexoctl dist disable mem api
Distribution `api` disabled.

$ nexoctl dist enable mem api
Distribution `api` enabled.

$ nexoctl dist export mem site -o site.yaml
Exported 1 distribution to site.yaml.

--- site.yaml
id: site
enabled: true
comment: the web site
aliases:
  - www.example.com
  - example.com
origin:
  bucket: web
  pathPrefix: /prod
mode: website
defaultBehavior:
  access: public
  indexDocument: index.html
  spaFallback: /index.html
behaviors:
  - pathPattern:
      type: glob
      pattern: /downloads/**
    access: signed
    signing:
      keyGroup: downloads
  - pathPattern:
      type: prefix
      pattern: /assets/
    cache:
      cacheControl: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
errorPages:
  - status: 404
    path: /404.html
redirects:
  - from: ^/old/(.*)$
    to: /new/$1
    status: 308
headers:
  response:
    Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
    Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains
    X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
    X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
    X-Site: prod
  cors:
    allowedOrigins:
      - https://app.example.com
restrictions:
  sourceIp:
    deny:
      - 203.0.113.0/24
  originSecretHeader:
    name: X-Origin-Secret
    values:
      - sha256:mem-13
tls:
  certificate: upload:dist-site
logging: {}

$ nexoctl dist rm mem api
Removed the distribution `api`.

$ nexoctl dist ls mem
ID                   STATE    MODE     ORIGIN               TLS                DOMAINS
site                 enabled  website  web/prod             upload:dist-site   www.example.com, example.com

